{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106230","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910623001:1":{"text":"向こうにトゲカジキがいる。奴らは光に集まる。凶暴で、目よりも耳が利く。","source_cn":"前面有棘剑鱼，它们趋光，凶残，听觉比视觉更灵敏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC52A49E38AF79977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910623002:1":{"text":"正面突破はやめておけ。奴らは群れで獲物を追い回し、骨だけになるまで喰らい尽くす。","source_cn":"别想着杀过去，它们会群聚追逐，直到把猎物啃成一具骨架。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7061BF2A1923FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1910623002":{"text":"正面突破はやめておけ。奴らは群れで獲物を追い回し、骨だけになるまで喰らい尽くす。","source_cn":"别想着杀过去，它们会群聚追逐，直到把猎物啃成一具骨架。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7061BF2A1923FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910623003:1":{"text":"ここを抜けた先には、ハダルが回遊季の儀式を行う重要な場所がある。一度見ておいたほうがいい。","source_cn":"通过这里，就是深海裔洄游季的重要仪式区，你们最好亲眼看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC71C6A09C1D33247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910623004:1":{"text":"トゲカジキは本能で光を追いかける。光源を見つけると、奴らは我を忘れて飛びつく。","source_cn":"棘剑鱼对光的追逐刻在骨血里，只要出现光源，它们会不顾一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE961A0446604BE5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_i